Data licence — data-diffed releases
===================================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the code in this repository. It does not
cover the data published in this repository's releases, and no licence is
granted over that data.

diffed-data.json is an internal build artifact. It describes what changed
between two consecutive data-transformed releases, and exists so the website
can render its New Listings feed and RSS without recomputing the diff. It is
published here because the pipeline runs in the open, not as a dataset offered
for reuse.

It inherits everything the transformed releases carry, including film metadata
from The Movie Database used under the TMDB API terms of use
(https://www.themoviedb.org/api-terms-of-use).

Concretely:

