    rights it would need to grant one.
  * There are no schema guarantees. The shape, the field names and the file
    layout change whenever the pipeline needs them to — without notice, without
    a version bump and without a deprecation period.
  * There is no warranty and no guarantee of accuracy, availability or
    continuity. Releases can stop, be deleted or be restructured at any time.

